       + '<span class="dim" style="font-size:12px">running ' + esc(wpRcDur(now - r.since)) + ' · ends in ' + esc(wpRcDur(r.expires - now)) + ' (a pass lasts ' + Math.round(r.ttl_ms / 3600000) + ' hours)</span>'
